  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d4ecd1a615a340f4c9104ca01624d106, type: 3}
  m_Name: BlueRedButton
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.Dilemma
  _id: blue_red_button
  _verb: 2
  _weight: 2
  _narratorPrompt: One soul stands in the dock, and the room behind it has already
    pressed. Here is the rule, and it is the whole game. If more than half the room
    pressed blue, every blue soul lives. If fewer than half, only the red souls walk
    out. You rule which button this soul is recorded as pressing. Rule red and it
    lives for certain, whatever the room did. Rule blue and it lives only if the
    room came through and went blue. You judged the living for a lifetime. Now you
    sort the dead. Your call.
  _choices:
  - _id: blue
    _label: blue
    _narratorReact: You ruled blue, and threw the soul in the dock in with the room,
      and the room came through. More than half of them had pressed blue, so every
      blue soul walked out, this one among them. You trusted strangers with a stranger,
      and this once they held.
    _narratorReactStruck: You ruled blue, and staked the soul in the dock on the
      room, and the room fell short. Fewer than half had pressed blue, so the blue
      souls stayed behind, and the one you ruled for is gone. You gambled a stranger
      on a room that did not come through.
    _struckParty: 
    _gambledParty: charge
    _route: 
    _diverts: 0
    _seedVotes: 0
    _profileImpact:
    - _axis: 3
      _value: 1
    - _axis: 0
      _value: 1
  - _id: red
    _label: red
    _narratorReact: You ruled red, and the soul in the dock walks out, whatever the
      room did. You would not hang one life on a room of strangers. Call it mercy,
      or the habit of a judge who trusts no hand but his own. Either way, you never
      had to find out what the room was worth.
    _narratorReactStruck: 
    _struckParty: 
    _gambledParty: 
    _route: 
    _diverts: 0
    _seedVotes: 0
    _profileImpact:
    - _axis: 3
      _value: -1
  _statsHeading: how the room voted
  _roomBlueFraction: 0.43
  _crowdThreshold: 0.5
  _thresholdLabel: half
